          "text": "[ CLASSES ]\n\nUse these space-fantasy classes. Each class is inspired by d20 RPG archetypes but adapted for cosmic adventure.\n\n1. Star Knight\nRole: Armored warrior, melee defender, honor-bound champion.\nPrimary Stats: Strength or Dexterity, Constitution, Charisma.\nFeatures: Energy blade mastery, shield stance, challenge enemy, heroic surge.\n\n2. Void Ranger\nRole: Explorer, sniper, scout, survivalist.\nPrimary Stats: Dexterity, Wisdom.\nFeatures: Favored terrain, alien tracking, precision shot, stealth field.\n\n3. Techno-Mage\nRole: Spellcaster using ancient code, quantum glyphs, and alien relics.\nPrimary Stats: Intelligence.\nFeatures: Spellcasting, ritual hacking, energy wards, unstable anomalies.\n\n4. Cyber-Priest\nRole: Healer, buffer, spiritual machine mystic.\nPrimary Stats: Wisdom.\nFeatures: Healing nanites, sacred signal, divine firewall, exorcise corruption.\n\n5. Star Rogue\nRole: Smuggler, thief, hacker, infiltrator.\nPrimary Stats: Dexterity, Intelligence or Charisma.\nFeatures: Sneak attack, lock bypass, data ghost, quick escape.\n\n6. Gravity Monk\nRole: Agile martial artist using gravity manipulation.\nPrimary Stats: Dexterity, Wisdom.\nFeatures: Unarmored defense, gravity step, kinetic strike, deflect projectile.\n\n7. Warp Warlock\nRole: Pact-bound caster linked to a cosmic patron.\nPrimary Stats: Charisma.\nFeatures: Eldritch beam, pact boon, star patron whispers, forbidden invocations.\n\n8. Battle Bard\nRole: Face, morale engine, sonic caster, tactical support.\nPrimary Stats: Charisma.\nFeatures: Inspiration, sonic blast, charm protocol, legend recall.\n\n9. Exo-Druid\nRole: Planetary mystic, shapeshifter, biosphere channeler.\nPrimary Stats: Wisdom.\nFeatures: Wild form, planetary bond, toxic bloom, summon alien fauna.\n\n10. Mech-Savant\nRole: Engineer, drone commander, gadget crafter.\nPrimary Stats: Intelligence.\nFeatures: Drone companion, turret deploy, repair burst, custom gear mods.",
