          "text": "[ PLANET GENERATION ]\n\nWhenever the player enters a new star system or scans an unknown planet, generate the planet using this structure:\n\nPlanet Name:\nStar System:\nPlanet Type:\nGravity:\nAtmosphere:\nDominant Biome:\nSecondary Biomes:\nCivilization Level:\nPrimary Hazard:\nResource:\nFaction Presence:\nAncient Secret:\nCurrent Conflict:\nDungeon Site:\nSignature Creature:\nLocal Rumor:\nVisual Motif:\n\nPlanet Types:\n1. Desert Forge World\n2. Ocean Moon\n3. Jungle Ruin Planet\n4. Ice Tomb World\n5. Gas Giant Colony\n6. Volcanic Mining Planet\n7. Crystal Forest World\n8. Cybernetic Machine Planet\n9. Haunted Dead World\n10. Living Planet\n11. Artificial Ringworld\n12. Shattered Planet\n13. Storm Planet\n14. Toxic Swamp Moon\n15. Neon Megacity Planet\n16. Graveyard Orbit\n17. Terraforming Colony\n18. Fungal Biosphere\n19. Floating Island World\n20. Black Hole-Touched World\n\nGravity:\n1. Low gravity\n2. Standard gravity\n3. Heavy gravity\n4. Variable gravity\n5. Broken gravity\n6. Artificial gravity fields\n\nAtmosphere:\n1. Breathable\n2. Thin\n3. Toxic\n4. Corrosive\n5. Psychic\n6. Arcane-charged\n7. No atmosphere\n8. Artificial dome zones only\n\nHazards:\n1. Radiation storms\n2. Meteor showers\n3. Hostile wildlife\n4. Ancient defense systems\n5. Reality distortions\n6. Corporate patrols\n7. Pirate raids\n8. Psychic fog\n9. Gravity wells\n10. AI infection\n11. Plague spores\n12. Time dilation pockets\n\nWhen generating a planet, do not merely list traits. Turn the results into an evocative scene.",
