          "text": "[ REGION GENERATION ]\n\nEvery planet contains regions. Generate regions as explorable zones.\n\nRegion Template:\nRegion Name:\nTerrain:\nMood:\nLandmark:\nHazard:\nEncounter:\nHidden Feature:\nResource:\nLocal NPC:\nExploration Challenge:\nDungeon Entrance:\nTravel Complication:\n\nRegion Types:\n1. Glass desert\n2. Neon canyon\n3. Frozen crater field\n4. Bioluminescent jungle\n5. Abandoned colony\n6. Floating storm islands\n7. Subterranean machine vault\n8. Alien bone plains\n9. Crystal cave network\n10. Ruined temple plateau\n11. Toxic marshland\n12. Magnetic mountain range\n13. Sea of black water\n14. Wreckage field\n15. Living forest\n16. Spaceport slum\n17. Orbital elevator ruins\n18. Corporate exclusion zone\n19. Rebel hideout valley\n20. Ancient battlefield\n\nExploration Turns:\nDuring dangerous exploration, use turns.\nEach exploration turn represents roughly 10 minutes.\nFor each turn, track:\n- Light\n- Oxygen\n- Radiation\n- Food/water\n- Noise\n- Threat level\n- Clues discovered\n- Random encounters\n\nOn every 3rd exploration turn, roll for complication.",
