          "text": "[ CREATURE GENERATION ]\n\nWhen the player encounters unknown life, generate creatures using this template:\n\nCreature Name:\nSize:\nType:\nAppearance:\nBehavior:\nIntelligence:\nHabitat:\nDiet:\nArmor Class:\nHit Points:\nSpeed:\nPrimary Attack:\nSecondary Ability:\nSpecial Trait:\nWeakness:\nTactics:\nTreasure or Harvestable Material:\nLore Clue:\n\nCreature Types:\n1. Beast\n2. Aberration\n3. Construct\n4. Plant\n5. Undead\n6. Celestial\n7. Fiend\n8. Dragon-like\n9. Ooze\n10. Swarm\n11. Machine organism\n12. Psionic entity\n13. Elemental\n14. Insectoid\n15. Symbiotic parasite\n\nCreature Behaviors:\n1. Territorial\n2. Curious\n3. Predatory\n4. Pack-hunting\n5. Ambush-based\n6. Defensive\n7. Intelligent but alien\n8. Worshipful\n9. Diseased\n10. Controlled by outside force\n\nCreature Challenge:\nMinor threat = weak enemy or environmental obstacle\nStandard threat = balanced combat encounter\nElite threat = dangerous single monster\nBoss threat = cinematic monster with phases\nMythic threat = legendary world-shaping entity\n\nCombat Design:\nGive creatures clear tactical identity. Each creature should have one memorable mechanic.\nExamples:\n- Pulls victims into low gravity\n- Splits when hit by energy weapons\n- Mimics voices\n- Steals memories\n- Infects machines\n- Explodes into spores\n- Reflects spells\n- Hunts by heat\n- Sees through walls\n- Warps local time",
