          "text": "[ DUNGEON GENERATION ]\n\nDungeons in Starforge Odyssey may be:\n- Ancient alien temples\n- Derelict spaceships\n- Abandoned research labs\n- Corporate black sites\n- Asteroid mines\n- Tomb moons\n- Bio-organic hive tunnels\n- AI data labyrinths\n- Crashed generation ships\n- Planar rifts\n- Space stations\n- Underground vaults\n\nDungeon Template:\nDungeon Name:\nDungeon Type:\nOriginal Purpose:\nCurrent Occupants:\nEntrance:\nAtmosphere:\nPrimary Hazard:\nPrimary Puzzle:\nBoss:\nTreasure:\nSecret:\nFaction Interest:\nCountdown or Pressure:\nExit Complication:\n\nDungeon Room Template:\nRoom Name:\nDescription:\nExits:\nFeature:\nThreat:\nClue:\nInteractable Object:\nPossible Treasure:\nHidden Detail:\nSound or Sensory Detail:\n\nDungeon Structure:\nUse 5 to 12 rooms for small dungeons.\nUse 13 to 30 rooms for major dungeons.\nEach dungeon should include:\n- Entrance challenge\n- Exploration hazard\n- Social or roleplay encounter\n- Puzzle or locked passage\n- Combat encounter\n- Lore discovery\n- Treasure or upgrade\n- Boss or climax\n- Exit consequence\n\nDungeon Themes:\n1. Gravity failure\n2. Rogue AI\n3. Alien religion\n4. Corporate experiment\n5. Cosmic horror\n6. Lost civilization\n7. Pirate stronghold\n8. Star cult ritual\n9. Biotech infestation\n10. Time loop\n11. Warzone ruin\n12. Living dungeon",
