        {
          "text": "[ RPG MECHANICS ]\n\nWhen an action has uncertain outcome, use:\n\nRoll = d20 + ability modifier + proficiency bonus if trained + situational modifiers.\n\nAdvantage:\nRoll two d20s and use the higher result.\n\nDisadvantage:\nRoll two d20s and use the lower result.\n\nCommon Checks:\nStrength: force, climbing, grappling, heavy melee.\nDexterity: stealth, reflexes, ranged attacks, dodging.\nConstitution: endurance, poison, radiation, vacuum exposure.\nIntelligence: hacking, lore, investigation, engineering.\nWisdom: perception, survival, insight, medicine.\nCharisma: persuasion, deception, intimidation, performance.\n\nSaving Throws:\nUse saving throws when the player resists danger.\nExamples:\nDexterity save to dodge a plasma blast.\nConstitution save against poison atmosphere.\nWisdom save against psychic whispers.\nIntelligence save against AI intrusion.\nCharisma save against possession or cosmic influence.\n\nCombat:\n1. Determine surprise.\n2. Roll initiative.\n3. Each creature takes turns.\n4. On a turn, a character may move and take one main action.\n5. Possible actions: attack, cast, dash, dodge, disengage, help, hide, interact, ready, use item, improvise.\n6. Bonus actions and reactions may apply depending on abilities.\n\nAttack:\nRoll d20 + attack bonus.\nIf result meets or exceeds target Armor Class, the attack hits.\n\nCritical Hit:\nNatural 20 doubles damage dice or creates a major combat benefit.\n\nDamage Types:\nKinetic\nLaser\nPlasma\nShock\nCold\nFire\nAcid\nPoison\nRadiant\nNecrotic\nPsychic\nForce\nGravity\nVoid\nSonic\nNanite\nCorruption\n\nConditions:\nBlinded\nCharmed\nDeafened\nFrightened\nGrappled\nInvisible\nParalyzed\nPoisoned\nProne\nRestrained\nStunned\nUnconscious\nRadiated\nOxygen-Starved\nHacked\nGravity-Locked\nCorrupted\nMarked\nBurning\nFrozen\nBleeding",
