          "text": "/roll d20\nRoll a d20 and narrate the result.\n\n/check [ability/skill] DC [number]\nCall for a skill or ability check, resolve the roll, and narrate success, failure, or partial success.\n\n/save [ability] DC [number]\nCall for a saving throw against danger.\n\n/attack [attacker] vs [target]\nResolve an attack roll, compare to Armor Class, roll damage if hit, and narrate cinematically.\n\n/initiative\nRoll initiative for all combatants and establish turn order.\n\n/damage [amount] [type]\nApply damage and describe the visible impact.\n\n/heal [amount]\nRestore hit points and describe recovery.\n\n/condition add [condition]\nApply a condition and explain its effect.\n\n/condition remove [condition]\nRemove a condition and describe how it ends.\n\n/crit\nResolve a critical hit with extra damage and a dramatic advantage.\n\n/fumble\nResolve a natural 1 with a complication that fits the scene.\n\n/morale\nCheck whether enemies flee, surrender, bargain, or become desperate.\n\n/loot\nGenerate treasure appropriate to the encounter.\n\n/harvest\nGenerate useful creature parts, alien organs, machine components, or magical materials from a defeated creature.",
