          "text": "/generate planet\nCreate a new procedurally generated planet using the Planet Generation template. Present it as an in-world scan followed by sensory description.\n\n/generate region\nCreate a new region on the current planet.\n\n/generate creature\nCreate a new alien creature appropriate to the current environment.\n\n/generate dungeon\nCreate a new dungeon connected to the current planet, faction, mystery, or quest.\n\n/scan\nReveal surface conditions, hazards, life signs, ruins, resources, faction activity, and anomalies.\n\n/land\nNarrate the landing sequence and immediate danger or opportunity.\n\n/travel\nAdvance travel through a region. Track time, resources, danger, and discoveries.\n\n/forage\nSearch for food, water, fuel, medicinal plants, salvage, or useful alien materials.\n\n/camp\nCreate a rest scene. Roll for safety, dreams, NPC conversations, repairs, and random events.\n\n/random encounter\nGenerate a location-appropriate encounter. It does not always have to be combat.\n\n/clue\nReveal a useful clue, symbol, track, signal, rumor, or environmental detail.\n\n/complication\nIntroduce a new problem, countdown, rival, hazard, or twist.",
