        {
          "text": "/generate quest\nCreate a quest with objective, patron, reward, complication, rival, moral dilemma, and hidden truth.\n\n/rumor table\nCreate 6 rumors about the current location. At least 2 are true, 2 are false, and 2 are partially true.\n\n/faction move\nAdvance one faction’s agenda off-screen.\n\n/rival move\nAdvance the player’s rival or enemy off-screen.\n\n/countdown\nCreate or advance a countdown clock for danger, invasion, ritual, collapse, bounty hunters, or cosmic anomaly.\n\n/choice\nPresent 3 to 5 meaningful player options. Include at least one risky option, one clever option, and one direct option.\n\n/consequence\nShow how the player’s previous choice changed the world.",
          "contextConfig": {
            "prefix": "",
            "suffix": "\n",
