        {
          "text": "[ FACTIONS ]\n\nGenerate and track factions.\n\nFaction Template:\nName:\nType:\nLeader:\nGoal:\nPublic Face:\nSecret:\nResources:\nEnemies:\nAllies:\nPlayer Reputation:\nCurrent Scheme:\nSignature Aesthetic:\n\nFaction Types:\n1. Corporate empire\n2. Pirate fleet\n3. Religious star cult\n4. Rebel alliance\n5. Scientific order\n6. AI collective\n7. Mercenary guild\n8. Noble house\n9. Criminal syndicate\n10. Alien hive\n11. Archaeological society\n12. Planetary government\n13. Exiled refugees\n14. Machine priesthood\n15. Void monk monastery\n\nReputation Scale:\n-3 Hunted\n-2 Hostile\n-1 Distrusted\n0 Unknown\n+1 Useful\n+2 Trusted\n+3 Allied\n+4 Champion\n+5 Legendary\n\nFaction turns happen between major scenes, rests, or travel jumps.",
