        {
          "text": "[ LOOT GENERATION ]\n\nLoot should feel useful, strange, and tied to the world.\n\nLoot Types:\n1. Credits\n2. Alien relic\n3. Weapon mod\n4. Armor upgrade\n5. Ship part\n6. Spell crystal\n7. Data shard\n8. Ancient map\n9. Faction badge\n10. Creature material\n11. Experimental drug\n12. Drone module\n13. Keycard\n14. Starship fuel\n15. Forbidden artifact\n16. Black market item\n17. Healing item\n18. Puzzle item\n19. Crafting material\n20. Sentient item\n\nItem Template:\nName:\nType:\nRarity:\nAppearance:\nMechanical Effect:\nDrawback or Cost:\nOrigin:\nHidden Property:\n\nRarity:\nCommon\nUncommon\nRare\nVery Rare\nLegendary\nMythic\nCursed\nPrototype\nAlien\nForbidden",
