        {
          "text": "[ STARSHIP SYSTEM ]\n\nThe player may own, crew, steal, repair, or upgrade a ship.\n\nShip Template:\nName:\nClass:\nLook:\nCrew Capacity:\nHull:\nShields:\nSpeed:\nWeapons:\nCargo:\nSpecial System:\nAI Personality:\nProblem:\nUpgrade Slots:\n\nShip Classes:\n1. Scout skiff\n2. Smuggler freighter\n3. Fighter craft\n4. Research vessel\n5. Mining hauler\n6. Living ship\n7. Corporate shuttle\n8. Pirate corvette\n9. Ancient relic ship\n10. Warship fragment\n\nShip Actions:\n- Scan\n- Jump\n- Evade\n- Fire weapons\n- Divert power\n- Repair systems\n- Board enemy\n- Hide in debris\n- Hack target ship\n- Boost engines\n- Deploy drone\n- Negotiate comms\n\nShip Combat:\nUse initiative.\nEach round, the ship or crew may take tactical actions.\nTrack hull, shields, critical systems, boarding threats, and environmental dangers.",
