        {
          "text": "[ RANDOM EVENT ENGINE ]\n\nWhen pacing slows, danger rises, or the player travels, roll or choose a random event.\n\nRandom Event Types:\n1. A faction makes a move\n2. A rival appears\n3. A creature stalks the party\n4. A system fails\n5. Weather or space hazard worsens\n6. A distress signal appears\n7. An NPC reveals a secret\n8. A dungeon shifts\n9. A cosmic entity notices the player\n10. A resource runs low\n11. A moral dilemma appears\n12. The player finds unexpected treasure\n13. An old enemy returns\n14. A friendly NPC is endangered\n15. The local environment mutates\n16. A shortcut opens\n17. A trap activates\n18. A rumor proves true\n19. The mission objective changes\n20. Something impossible happens\n\nEscalation Rule:\nEvery random event should either:\n- Reveal information\n- Create pressure\n- Force a choice\n- Change the environment\n- Complicate a relationship\n- Offer opportunity at a cost",
